        "7b9" to Rows("V7 of a minor key: the ♭9 is the key's ♭6 (from harmonic minor), falling to the 5th of i."),
        "7alt" to Rows("A dominant whose tensions are all altered (♭9 ♯9 ♯11 ♭13), from the altered scale; strongest resolving to I or i.", "Jazz."),
        "add9" to Rows("A triad with the 9th and no 7th.", "Pop and rock guitar, open ringing voicings."),
        "maj9" to Rows("Imaj9 and IVmaj9: the major 7th chord with the 9th.", "Jazz, neo-soul, R&B."),
        "m9" to Rows("ii9 or i9: the minor 7th chord with the 9th.", "Jazz, neo-soul, R&B."),
        "13" to Rows("A dominant with the 13th over the 3rd and 7th; the 11th is left out over the major 3rd.", "Jazz, blues and funk."),
