        "P1" to "Two voices on one pitch: doubling, not harmony.",
        "m2" to "The smallest step of the scale and the sharpest dissonance: the leading tone to the tonic, the ♭9 against a root.",
        "M2" to "A whole step: most steps of a scale; as a harmony, the soft dissonance of sus2 and add9.",
