        "d5" to "The tritone spelled as a 5th: the 5th of a diminished triad, resolving inward (in C, B up to C, F down to E).",
        "P5" to "The root and 5th of every major and minor triad; the power chord; the step of the circle of fifths.",
        "A5" to "The 5th of an augmented triad, the ♯5 of 7♯5: it rises a half step.",
        "m6" to "The inversion of a major 3rd; the ♭6 that falls to the 5th in minor.",
