        "m7" to "The 7th of dominant and minor 7th chords; it resolves down a step.",
        "M7" to "The 7th of a maj7 chord: a half step under the octave.",
        "d7" to "The 7th of a diminished 7th chord, the same keys as a major 6th.",
        "P8" to "The same note at double the frequency: doubling, not harmony.",
        "m9" to "The ♭9: an altered tension on dominants, harsh on other chords.",
        "M9" to "The 9th: a colour added to almost any chord.",
        "A9" to "The ♯9: the minor 3rd above a dominant, spelled as a 9th so the chord keeps its major 3rd.",
        "m10" to "A minor 3rd plus an octave: the spread voicing's left-hand 10th on a minor chord.",
        "M10" to "A major 3rd plus an octave: the left-hand 10th of stride and spread piano.",
        "P11" to "The 11th: a natural tension on minor chords, avoided over a major 3rd.",
        "A11" to "The ♯11: the Lydian colour on major and dominant chords.",
